    "narrative": "The heart of our lineup today rests on **Josh Naylor** (78.46) and **Vinnie Pasquantino** (76.21), both of whom benefit immensely from exploitable matchups against soft-tossing righties. **Josh Naylor** enjoys a significant boost due to Littell\u2019s 4.78 xERA, creating an environment where his power profile should play up, while **Vinnie Pasquantino** remains a set-and-forget anchor against Tatsuya Imai, fueled by a massive +14% platoon edge that keeps his efficiency score comfortably in the elite tier. Meanwhile, **Corbin Carroll** (72.85) remains a must-start despite the tough matchup against Lodolo; his dynamic speed profile is the engine of our roster, and even against a decent lefty, his floor remains high due to his consistent presence in the #2 hole and potential for stolen bases.\n\nWe have opted to keep **Brice Turang** (48.67) on the bench today, making him our most difficult cut. While **Brice Turang** carries the requisite speed we covet, the combination of a sub-optimal matchup against Banks and the presence of superior efficiency scores from **Kyle Karros** (61.25) and **Tyler Soderstrom** (61.53) left him as the odd man out. The decision was primarily driven by our optimization model favoring the lineup order advantages for **Kyle Karros** and **Tyler Soderstrom**, who are projected to see higher-leverage plate appearances than the bottom-of-the-order potential for others. \n\nRisk management remains a priority given that we are monitoring lineup confirmations for **Max Muncy**, **Kyle Karros**, **Tyler Soderstrom**, and **Seiya Suzuki**. **Seiya Suzuki** (51.79) is particularly vulnerable today; his score is dragged down by a poor park factor and a concern regarding the opposing catcher\u2019s elite pop time, which limits his stolen base equity. If any of these \"Lineup Pending\" designations shift toward the bottom of the batting order, their efficiency scores will be reassessed, but for now, we are comfortable rolling with this roster as our most efficient path to category dominance.",
